The graph shows a quantity $N$ modelled by $N=Ae^{kt}$, with $t$ in hours. Which equation matches the graph?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\begin{axis}[axis lines=middle, xlabel={$t$}, ylabel={$N$}, xmin=-0.5, xmax=4.4, ymin=-8, ymax=90, xtick={1,2,3,4}, ytick={5,40}, samples=100, clip=false]
\addplot[thick, ->, domain=0:4] {5*exp(0.693147*x)};
\addplot[dashed] coordinates {(0,40) (3,40) (3,0)};
\addplot[only marks, mark=*] coordinates {(0,5) (3,40)};
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
